"[{\"id\":\"e4d0856\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"animation\":\"fadeIn\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c48a432\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2f3c9c9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"sx-hero-meta\\\"><span class=\\\"sx-hero-eyebrow\\\">RS-485 Isolation Module</span><span class=\\\"sx-hero-sku\\\">SKU: ISO-M485</span></div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"5bccd9c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"ISO-M485 SERIES\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"title_color\":\"#3C7D47\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"15\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":true},\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"57292b7\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c39ffa8\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3a97014\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"sx-section sx-industries sx-prod-apps\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-industries-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-eyebrow\\\">Applications</span>\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sx-industries-title\\\">Where ISO-M485 is deployed</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"sx-chip-row\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">SCADA Networks</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">PLC Field Bus</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Modbus RTU Networks</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Industrial Sensors</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Energy Monitoring</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Solar PV Strings</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Maritime Comm</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Substation Telemetry</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"cfb6020\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Reliable RS-485 Communication, Reinforced with Isolation & Surge Protection\\n\\n\",\"header_size\":\"div\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals/typography?id=secondary\",\"title_color\":\"globals/colors?id=accent\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"69edade\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://suriota.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/isolated-poster-v2.webp\",\"id\":1732,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"9ad71a7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>When your operations depend on fast, stable, and secure data communication, you can&rsquo;t afford downtime or interference. The ISO-M485 Series is engineered for industrial-grade RS-485 connections with built-in galvanic isolation and robust surge protection, ensuring maximum reliability in the most demanding environments.</p><p><strong>Boost Your Communication. Protect Your Investment.</strong><br/>With the ISO-M485 Series, you get speed, stability, and protection all in one compact, reliable device.</p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"2932b30\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-section sx-whyus sx-prod-features\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-whyus-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-eyebrow\\\">KEY FEATURES</span>\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sx-whyus-title\\\">Why engineers choose ISO-M485</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"sx-whyus-grid\\\">\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">01</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">2.5kV Optical Isolation</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\"><strong>Optocoupler isolation</strong> between RS-485 ports protects upstream PLC/SCADA from ground loops and field-side faults.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">02</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Built-in Surge Protection</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Integrated <strong>TVS diodes + gas discharge tubes</strong> guard against lightning-induced and switching transients on outdoor cables.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">03</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">256 Devices Per Bus</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Extended driver capacity supports up to <strong>256 nodes per segment</strong>. Auto direction control simplifies wiring.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">04</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Industrial Temp Range</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\"><strong>-40°C to +85°C</strong> operation. DIN rail mountable. Rated for continuous operation in harsh field cabinets.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">05</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Flexible Wide Power Input</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Accepts <strong>7-15VDC or 9-24VDC</strong> supply variants for easy integration with industrial 12V or 24V control panels.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">06</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">High-Speed Data Rate</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Supports up to <strong>500 kbps</strong> data rate (within distance limits) for high-throughput SCADA and PLC networks.</p></article>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"a07c5f3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"sx-action-group\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"sx-action-btn sx-action-btn--primary\\\" href=\\\"https://www.tokopedia.com/suriota\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" aria-label=\\\"Order ISO-M485 on Tokopedia\\\">\\n    <svg width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"9\\\" cy=\\\"21\\\" r=\\\"1\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"20\\\" cy=\\\"21\\\" r=\\\"1\\\"/><path d=\\\"M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6\\\"/></svg>\\n    <span>Order on Tokopedia</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-action-arrow\\\">→</span>\\n  </a>\\n  <a class=\\\"sx-action-btn sx-action-btn--secondary\\\" href=\\\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12XOl4YRrcpPVdAbYFFdjo-ylfev5Z-Lu?usp=sharing\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" aria-label=\\\"Download ISO-M485 datasheet\\\">\\n    <svg width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\\\"/><polyline points=\\\"14 2 14 8 20 8\\\"/><line x1=\\\"12\\\" y1=\\\"18\\\" x2=\\\"12\\\" y2=\\\"12\\\"/><polyline points=\\\"9 15 12 18 15 15\\\"/></svg>\\n    <span>Download Datasheet</span>\\n  </a>\\n</div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"c92048d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-faq\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-faq-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-eyebrow\\\">FAQ</span>\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sx-faq-title\\\">ISO-M485 | Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>What isolation voltage does ISO-M485 provide?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">2.5kV optocoupler isolation between RS-485 ports protects upstream PLC/SCADA equipment from ground loops, common-mode noise, and field-side faults. Galvanic isolation prevents damaging currents from propagating to your control room.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>How many devices per RS-485 bus?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">Up to 256 nodes per segment with the extended driver capacity. Standard RS-485 supports 32 devices - ISO-M485's 1/8 unit-load driver enables 8× larger networks without needing repeaters.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>What is the operating temperature range?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">-40°C to +85°C continuous operation. Designed for harsh field cabinets, outdoor enclosures, and unconditioned spaces typical in industrial and utility deployments.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>Does it include built-in surge protection?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">Yes. Integrated TVS diodes and gas discharge tubes guard against lightning-induced and switching transients on outdoor cables. No external SPD required for moderate exposure environments.</div></details>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n<script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">\\n{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What isolation voltage does ISO-M485 provide?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"2.5kV optocoupler isolation between RS-485 ports. Protects upstream PLC/SCADA from ground loops and field-side faults.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How many devices per RS-485 bus?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Up to 256 nodes per segment with extended driver capacity, 8x larger than standard RS-485.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is the operating temperature range?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"-40°C to +85°C continuous operation, suitable for harsh field cabinets and outdoor enclosures.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Does it include built-in surge protection?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Integrated TVS diodes and gas discharge tubes guard against lightning-induced transients.\\\"}}\\n]}\\n</script>\"},\"eleme